{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Senseless Soccer is a football game where your goal is not just to score goals: instead, you create powerful synergies and combos in order to collect ridiculous amounts of money!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's SUPER! It's SENSELESS! It's SOCCER!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328320/extras/259fbccac33016a5240347ffb59c3d42.avif?t=1770340303\" width=560 height=200 /></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game starts out as a standard 5-a-side football match, but you very quickly learn that the rules are meant to be broken in increasingly hilarious ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your players with weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add a Sheep, Goose, Dog or Cat</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a variety of Special Team Mates (including the Referee)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurl random objects at your opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump onto the field as a Manager... and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328320/extras/b059490b023d1ac8a1abd3636c8ad344.avif?t=1770340303\" width=560 height=200 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than a hundred different upgrades available, every game is guaranteed to be unique and different. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix different Upgrade Tickets, Player Traits and Special Team Mates to unlock game breaking combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How about multiple balls on the field at once? Easily done! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely lopsided 11 vs 5 match? Perfectly normal! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Millions of dollars from a single combo? You got it!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328320/extras/d39fea40c61a9f699f6fb15b43b5c5fd.avif?t=1770340303\" width=560 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game the way YOU want. It's the beautiful game, after all!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 stage single-player campaign, with an endless Exhibition Match mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 player local co-op: enjoy a cooperative game of football with your real-life friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Steam Leaderboard to compete with the entire world!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328320?t=1770340303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328320?t=1770340303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328320/796b2b0fc0ec751dd47c8ad9b16d652a72059219/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770340303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328320/796b2b0fc0ec751dd47c8ad9b16d652a72059219/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770340303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sha